{"server":"tw","storyId":"act27side_level_act27side_08_beg","groupId":"act27side","stageId":"act27side_08","title":"愛之歌","storyCode":"SL-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6c93483385e97f516090598d48627056e267788a441b6f4252d90d6165f341fa","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"火山數據異常，面對艾雅法拉的堅持，凱勒終於不再逃避過去，在瑙曼夫婦去世後第一次登上火山進行數據探查。晚會被迫結束，眾人開始撤離。卡恩終於找到當年的證據，追上凱勒質問瑙曼夫婦去世的真相。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_beach_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾......真是個好聽的名字，我可以直接叫你阿黛爾嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你有聽說過嗎，每個第一次爬上火山的人都會做的一件事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是在岩漿上烤羽獸蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我以我爬過二十七座火山的經歷向你保證，在烤羽獸蛋方面，岩漿和源石火爐沒有任何區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總之都會被你烤焦就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！明明你每次都吃得很香！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，阿黛爾。你可以跟在我的後面。我踩過的地面總是結實的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"緊張的話，要不要拉住我的手？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾，你之前不是問我們為什麼熱愛火山？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我向你保證，只要你親眼見過一次火山爆發，就永遠無法忘記那種感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我喜歡靜靜地坐在火山上思考。大地和我們自身都充滿謎團，可能窮盡我們一生都無法解答其萬一，但我非常享受這種解謎的過程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人類發明了移動城市，卻至今未能完全弄清天災形成的原因，人類利用源石創造了許多工具，卻對這種石頭於我們本身的反噬束手無策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人類應該在面對這些自然的偉力時認清自己的渺小，這樣他們就不會將太多精力投入到無意義的自相殘殺上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾，不用太在意卡提亞的悲觀論調，畢竟這片大地上不是每個地方都像汐斯塔一樣單純。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作為一個捲在貴族矛盾間的學者，卡提亞有些抱怨也是正常的。不過在這些問題上我一直和他有不同的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人當然是渺小的，但也正因為渺小，可以讓我們在這片大地上有容身之處。"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g8_siestavolcanomuseum_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒教授，這是一號監測站訊號丟失前的兩個小時裡傳送回來的數據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們從來沒有見過這樣的異常，只能請您來判斷......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地表氣體濃度沒有變化，為什麼溫度突然提升了這麼多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這個數值是真的，那說明汐斯塔火山裡積蓄的能量突然增加了十倍......不，這怎麼想都是不可能的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......當作異常數據忽視就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告知市政廳火山活動更加活躍，讓市民們做好準備，我們能做的也沒有別的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒老師，這可能不是普通的數據異常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得，在爸爸媽媽的研究筆記裡，也提到過幾次類似的狀況......火山周圍的溫度異常地高，與其他數值不配對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然始終找不到原因，但很難用巧合解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒老師，我們不需要去現場確認一下嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一號監測站就在火山山腰上，現在正是最危險的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出現這種數據只可能是儀器出了故障，沒有必要再冒險去現場查驗了。最後的觀測結果的數據可以根據其他觀測站的數據再做校正。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒老師，我不明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您一直在說，這次觀測很重要，是許多學者都在等待的機會。這座城市還有幾十萬人的生活可能會受到影響，難道不應該盡可能嚴謹嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果現在逃避......不就等於承認他們的犧牲是毫無意義的？"},{"type":"narration","text":"女孩聲音不大，身體微微顫抖。好像只是這樣認真地表達自己的心思，就要耗費她不少力氣。\n凱勒有些恍然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒老師，我好像不能說服您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您不願意去的話，那我可以自己去嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別開玩笑了，現在火山上狀況不明，怎麼可能讓你自己去那麼危險的地方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_180_amgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒老師......可以把媽媽的那件防護服，還給我嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g6_siestaunbuiltland_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們除了吃東西，還有什麼別的事情可以做？再這麼吃下去我肚子就要撐爆了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再聽兩首吉他曲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......感覺應該會有點更有意思的事情才對的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在哪有黑曜石音樂節好玩呀？那麼多人，那麼多遊客，看不到尾的街道和店鋪，永遠也停不下來的音樂聲。那個時候多好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這個晚會，倒是讓我想起了第一次黑曜石音樂節的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第一次黑曜石音樂節？那都是多少年前的事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在都沒幾個人記得了，第一次黑曜石音樂節其實就是在礦坑裡，是一群礦上的工人辦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒幾個人，也沒有一個像樣的樂手，就那樣隨手彈著曲子，唱著自己編的歌，就這麼辦了起來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個時候哪能想到後來能辦得那麼大，吸引了多少人來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我們這個晚會還會有下次嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，這誰都沒法給個定論啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可要是搬去市中心那邊，你們這些店是不是都不會再開了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是吧，可能也該換個活法了。誰的生活又是一成不變的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，以後我們也會在空了的時候來這裡，擺一下攤，彈幾首歌，有人來的話就請他吃兩串，沒人的話就我們自己看看海，看看對面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還從之前的沙灘上帶了一罐沙子來這裡呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店女老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1001_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要是火山爆發的話，之前的地方就全都是火山灰了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店女老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1001_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走過的路，我們轉過的小店，我們踩過的沙灘，都會被蓋在火山灰下面吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你也會記得今天我們在這裡辦的晚會，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店女老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1001_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......當然，這也是新的記憶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老闆撥動手中的吉他，遠處傳來其他人嬉鬧的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你們不跳舞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個時候該跳舞了，年輕人們！像現在這樣吃吃喝喝聊聊天，可算不上晚會啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，讓我也換首曲子彈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊那位女士，一起嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_993_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伯德撥動琴弦，悠揚的小調環繞著這片地塊。人們躺倒在草地上，看著夜空、螢火和繁星點點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"滋滋啦啦，一陣不和諧的電流聲響起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"根據觀測到的火山反應，汐斯塔火山很可能會在數小時之內爆發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"移動城市已經遠離火山爆發的影響範圍，請大家不用驚慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火山爆發的震動可能會引發海嘯，請所有市民立即離開海邊，請所有市民立即離開海邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就要爆發了？今天？現在？真是挑了個不好的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或許也是個好時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼叫快離開海邊？這裡會被淹嗎？那這些東西還要不要了？留在這裡會被沖走的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別拿了，先離開要緊吧！"},{"type":"narration","text":"老闆停下彈琴的手，看向自己的伴侶。燒烤的油煙仍未消散，她臉上有著還未褪去的快樂的紅暈。\n她遺憾地放下手中的燒烤鐵籤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店女老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1001_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，可能在我們離開之後，海浪會吞掉我們今天的腳印......包括我的燒烤架，你的吉他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來是火山和大海來幫我們和過去的東西告別了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們該往上走了，上面不會被海水淹沒，我們還會有新的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店女老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1001_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在市中心那裡嗎？我總擔心那裡太狹窄，放不下你所有的樂器，也放不下我的燒烤架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是能放得下你和我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老闆看著自己伴侶的眼睛，他的眼睛閃閃發亮。\n她突然笑了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店女老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1001_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也對！那其實就夠了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，親愛的，那其實就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧！快把湯姆爺爺拉上，看他行動那麼緩慢，別哭著捨不得自己的寶貝冰淇淋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店女老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1001_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——湯姆爺爺——！快走啦！要不然海浪過來，你就要和你的冰淇淋漂流去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呦......哎呦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個幫我搬冰淇淋的小姑娘呢？可不能把她落下了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g8_siestavolcanomuseum_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（找到了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（缺失的兩頁筆記，的確是卡提亞教授的字跡。還有軍方的火漆印......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（凱勒，你到底還在隱瞞什麼......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡恩博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你......凱勒教授呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兩個小時前火山監測站的訊號斷了，最後傳來的數據，非常古怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她為什麼沒有通知其他人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒教授說，情況很緊急，她要自己去檢查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是一個人去的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，好像還有那位從萊塔尼亞來的實習生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不安的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們真的已經撤離到安全地帶了對吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡離火山足足有一百公里，應該不會有事的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"市政廳是這麼說的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不安的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是......你有沒有感覺到地面在震動？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！你有見到麗芙嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是留在家裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛回來的時候發現她不見了，她沒有去找你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g6_siestaunbuiltland_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？人好像都不見了......大家都去別的地方玩了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你在這裡呀......你也和朋友走丟了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"narration","text":"運具停在了山腳，熟悉的山脈已換了一副面貌。\n山上的植物早已枯萎，嶙峋的山岩更顯得高大。\n暮色將沉，在二人的心頭降下陰影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是......汐斯塔火山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾，小心點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"運具只能開到這裡，剩下的路只能徒步走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一號觀測站在山腰，離這裡還有一段路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事的，我的體力還跟得上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"narration","text":"學者低下了頭，心中刺痛著。\n......恐懼的人到底是誰呢？\n火山就在眼前，自己卻一步也無法上前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒老師，您還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要不要拉住我的手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"narration","text":"暗紅色的溪流在山岩上蔓延爬行，如同血管。龐然巨物正在粗重地喘息。\n從地心到這座山崖，它們流過了漫長的歲月，熾熱、沉默。\n這段路似乎沒有阿黛爾想像的那麼遠，憑她現在的體力，還是能獨自爬到這山腰上。\n這段路又似乎比想像的要長很多，夠記憶在心底沖洗過無數回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"設置的觀測站就在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些儀器......有人來過這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是山上沒有別人的腳印......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"源石能量反應沒有變，但測溫裝置的確記錄到了高溫反應......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"環顧四周，也只能看到陰影中漆黑的山岩與熔化的石頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是沒什麼狀況了，重新調試好設備後我們就回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡恩，你為什麼會來這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（氣喘吁吁）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說......你們......上火山了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"監測站的數據出現了一些波動，阿黛爾很不放心，所以來檢查一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是意外導致的，我們正準備撤去安全的觀測點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座火山的確開始活躍起來了，爆發的時間可能還要提前一些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我們先回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒，站住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡恩前輩？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"氣喘吁吁的男人身體顫抖著，從懷中掏出一個資料袋。而在看到資料袋封面的瞬間，凱勒立即變了臉色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"1095年9月，烏納火山，你為什麼突然離開了考察隊伍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同年十一月，你沒有出席瑙曼夫婦的葬禮，卻有人在威廉大學與軍方的座談會上見過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，卡提亞·瑙曼關於源石與天災的研究資料，連阿黛爾都沒有見過，為什麼會出現在你與萊塔尼亞軍方的書信裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒......回答我的問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒老師......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾，我說過，等這次觀測之後，我會對你坦白一切......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡恩，這裡很危險，我們還是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱勒......我們現在就站在這裡，站在瑙曼博士他們也來過的火山上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面對這樣的景象，你還要撒謊嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔，雖然很不想插手人類的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是這裡實在不是什麼吵架的好地方啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
